2. Stockfish (chess engine)
---------------------------

The app bundles the Stockfish 18 chess engine (arm64-v8a-dotprod build)
as a native ARM64 library, libstockfish.so (114,115,752 bytes; SHA-256
8f7116d3f1a7004a6581d4fb0c1ff891ce095bab6d45e52f1578897cf23b61b5 — the
same value is hardcoded as EXPECTED_ENGINE_SHA256 in StockfishNative and
verified at runtime on engine extraction; on rooted devices, cached
engine reuse is re-verified via RootDetector). The binary is NOT
committed to the source tree: it is downloaded at build time into
src/main/jniLibs/arm64-v8a/ with a SHA-256 check (see BUILDING.md).

  - Copyright (C) Tord Romstad, Marco Costalba, Joona Kiiski,
    Gary Linscott and the Stockfish contributors (see AUTHORS-stockfish).
  - License: GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE Version 3 or later
    (LICENSE-GPL v3).
  - Upstream: https://stockfishchess.org / https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish

Stockfish runs as a separate process spawned by the app and communicates
exclusively via the UCI text protocol over stdin/stdout pipes.


