7. Lichess tablebase API (online service)
-----------------------------------------

The endgame tablebase probe feature queries the public Lichess
tablebase API (https://tablebase.lichess.ovh) over HTTPS with
certificate pinning (TlsSecurityHelper). This is the app's ONLY network
access, and only on explicit user request; it sends the queried board
position (FEN) to the service. It is an online service, not a bundled
component; see PRIVACY.md for the data-flow disclosure.

  - Service: https://lichess.org (tablebase API documentation:
    https://lichess.org/api#tag/Tablebase)


